{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"a5d0e6be4d2e0f274fc0b4719ccf81460e27844947f85b8342b439680f826df1"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:d42db5ffa456e81d14bd72fffe931c9ca84db61a817e9c6c84d71187fdd2d35c","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"The powerful impression the veterans made on him","evidence":"[D24:3 | 3:34 pm on 17 July, 2023] John: I heard some cool stories from an elderly veteran named Samuel. It was inspiring and heartbreaking, but seeing their resilience really filled me with hope. It reminded me why I wanted to join the military.","itemId":"urn:uuid:4c0f9f63-91a6-5cb7-8d04-95e1db2ffc74","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:776dfdb1771669506b9891da182adb35affd1cbbcf45f4b5baa27947d0b166d9","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Why did John feel inspired to join the military after the visit to the hospital?","referenceAnswer":"seeing the resilience of the veterans","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"776dfdb1771669506b9891da182adb35affd1cbbcf45f4b5baa27947d0b166d9"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}